## 1. Physical space and changed permissions

Let M=2n with integer n>=2, L=M-1, and let a chain of M battery qubits have actual free generator Delta B, B=sum_(j=1)^M n_j, Delta>0. Retain a finite old register with literal K>=0, and an arbitrary untouched reference R. During this preparation the old register is exactly decoupled from the battery. Thus the complete baseline is F0=K+Delta B and old aging remains exp(-itK/hbar). The initial battery is independently vacuum. No resource or reference output is removed.

Write p_m=|1^m0^(M-m)> for0<=m<=M and let P be their full prefix span. Define the unitary reflection J as reversing site order and flipping every bit. Then Jp_m=p_(M-m), J^2=I and JBJ=M I-B on the entire battery. J is a mathematical symmetry, not an extra supplied instantaneous operation.

The new supplied interaction on an interior triple2<=j<=M-1 is

    F_j=n_(j-1) Y_j (I-n_(j+1)),
    Y|0>=i|1>,  Y|1>=-i|0>.

These are Hermitian norm-one three-site terms on consecutive sites. They preserve P exactly and on P act as

    F_j=i|p_j><p_(j-1)|-i|p_(j-1)><p_j|.             (1)

Indeed either a prefix ends at j-1 or j and is moved across that boundary, or one of the two control projections is zero. This proof is on every p_m, not a compression imposed after an actual step. On the full battery,

    JF_jJ=-F_(M+1-j).                                (2)

The flipped neighbor projections exchange their roles and Y changes sign. Their factors lie on distinct sites and commute, proving (2) without assuming a prefix input.

Compared with the parent two-site nY gates, these three-site filtered flips and simultaneous mirror matching are stronger physical permissions. This is an explicit tradeoff, not a free replacement of existing hardware. Actual strengths, supports, independent vacuum, old isolation, clock and rotating quadratures still have to be supplied.

## 2. A quotient-chain circuit with actual scalar reserves

