All c_k are positive and sum c_k^2=1. Set w_k=sum_(l=k)^(n-1)c_l^2, and for0<=k<=n-2 choose theta_k in[0,pi/2] with cos(theta_k)=c_k/sqrt(w_k), sin(theta_k)=sqrt(w_(k+1)/w_k). Then

